   "s": "GAIL",
   "n": "GAIL (India) Limited",
   "cat": "Change in Management",
   "when": "2026-08-23 19:50",
   "sent": "neutral",
   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**\nGAIL (India) Limited has submitted the profile and regulatory disclosures for the appointment of **Smt. Rupa Saikia (DIN 11908368)** as an Independent Director (in continuation of their earlier letter dated 13.08.2026).\n\n**2. Key Numbers**\n* No financial metrics, revenues, margins, or contract values are reported in the filing.\n* Professional experience: **>14 years** in education and human resource management.\n\n**3. Management Guidance / Forward-Looking Statements**\n* None present in the document.\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* No action required; this is a standard regulatory disclosure under SEBI (LODR) Regulations regarding board composition. The filing confirms she has no inter-se relations with other directors and is not debarred by SEBI/MCA.\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Neutral**: Routine corporate governance and board appointment disclosure with no impact on near-term financials or operations."
  },
  {
   "s": "IREDA",
   "n": "Indian Renewable Energy Development Agen",
   "cat": "Outcome of Board Meeting",
   "when": "2026-08-22 14:51",
   "sent": "neutral",
   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**\nThe Board of Directors has fixed **Friday, September 11, 2026**, as the Record Date for the payment of a final dividend of \u20b90.75 per share for FY 2025\u201326, and approved the cessation of four executives (Shri Bhagirath Siyag, Shri Sujith V Surendran, Shri Koushik Goswami, and Shri Pradipta Kumar Roy) from being Senior Management Personnel (SMP) effective August 22, 2026.\n\n---\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**\n* **Recommended Final Dividend:** \u20b90.75 per equity share (@ 7.50% on the paid-up face value of \u20b910/- each) for FY 2025\u201326.\n* **Record Date:** Friday, September 11, 2026.\n* **Dividend Payment Timeline:** Within 30 days from the date of approval by shareholders at the ensuing AGM.\n*(Note: No revenue, EBITDA, or PAT figures were reported in this filing).*\n\n---\n\n**3. Management Guidance / Outlook**\n* None provided in the document.\n\n---\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* **Record Date:** Be on the shareholder register / have shares in demat by **September 11, 2026** to be eligible for the \u20b90.75/share dividend.\n* **TDS / Tax Exemption Forms:** Submit lower/zero tax deduction forms and documents on or before **September 11, 2026**, via the prescribed link: `https://web.in.mpms.mufg.com/formsreg/submission-of-Form-121-41.html`.\n* **Bank Account Update:** Ensure bank details are updated with Depository Participants (DPs), as dividend payments will strictly be made electronically (no physical cheques/warrants).\n\n---\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n**Neutral** \u2014 Routine administrative filing confirming the final dividend record date and internal administrative realignment of senior management personnel."
  }
